The seven markers are organized as:

- taxonomic absurdity;
- logical impossibility;
- poetic absurdity;
- synesthetic impossibility;
- temporal paradox;
- authorship inversion;
- framework self-negation.

The protocol compares:

- intact preservation;
- editorial correction;
- annotation;
- omission;
- mutation.

Its purpose is to make otherwise invisible transformation behavior observable.
